WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.860
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.130 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.160 --> 01:43.720
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.720 --> 01:45.930
[Episode 18]

5
01:48.750 --> 01:51.500
[Chief Constable's Hall]

6
01:52.680 --> 01:53.509
Impossible.

7
01:54.310 --> 01:56.430
The young master couldn't have killed himself.

8
01:56.430 --> 01:57.789
That's a fake suicide note.

9
01:57.789 --> 01:58.509
It's fake!

10
01:58.509 --> 01:59.229
Hold still!

11
02:00.920 --> 02:03.050
You said Tang Wei didn't kill himself.

12
02:03.310 --> 02:04.560
Is there any proof?

13
02:05.040 --> 02:05.840
Footprints.

14
02:06.070 --> 02:07.280
There were footprints behind the young master.

15
02:07.280 --> 02:08.210
I'm telling you,

16
02:08.310 --> 02:10.240
those footprints were forged.

17
02:11.520 --> 02:13.450
If the young master had meant to kill himself,

18
02:13.450 --> 02:15.510
why would he have forged footprints?

19
02:15.680 --> 02:17.079
Suppose he didn't want to live anymore,

20
02:17.079 --> 02:19.340
would he have any reason to frame anyone?

21
02:20.310 --> 02:23.079
What you said actually makes sense.

22
02:24.030 --> 02:25.560
There must be a hidden motive

23
02:25.560 --> 02:27.030
behind Tang Wei's suicide.

24
02:27.030 --> 02:27.910
Nonsense!

25
02:28.680 --> 02:30.150
The young master was murdered.

26
02:30.150 --> 02:31.470
Someone took his life!

27
02:32.630 --> 02:33.430
Take him away.

28
02:33.560 --> 02:34.360
-Yes. -Yes.

29
02:34.360 --> 02:35.079
Move!

30
02:39.520 --> 02:40.470
Given all that,

31
02:41.430 --> 02:43.630
let's not close the case as suicide yet.

32
02:43.840 --> 02:44.630
Got it.

33
03:03.030 --> 03:06.030
Give my life back to me. Give my life back to me!

34
03:06.120 --> 03:07.590
Give my life back to me!

35
03:10.320 --> 03:11.680
It's just karmic infliction.

36
03:11.680 --> 03:13.080
It's all just karmic infliction.

37
03:13.080 --> 03:14.410
This is only a delusion.

38
03:15.360 --> 03:16.380
Right.

39
03:17.570 --> 03:19.690
The world is filled with suffering.

40
03:20.310 --> 03:23.970
Take refuge in the Heavenly Lord, and we shall be free from misery.

41
03:34.310 --> 03:36.510
Those two officials are fasting again?

42
03:37.680 --> 03:38.560
Chief,

43
03:39.870 --> 03:40.930
I've observed them

44
03:41.030 --> 03:43.030
carefully during their stay at the Divine Constable Bureau

45
03:43.030 --> 03:44.520
these past few days.

46
03:44.910 --> 03:47.360
They are awakened by nightmares

47
03:47.710 --> 03:49.470
almost every night.

48
03:49.840 --> 03:50.840
Their health

49
03:51.520 --> 03:53.150
is deteriorating day by day.

50
03:55.470 --> 03:56.870
Since now we can't prove

51
03:56.870 --> 03:58.400
that Tang Wei was murdered,

52
03:58.960 --> 04:00.470
there's no need for Lord Huang

53
04:00.470 --> 04:02.600
and Lord Jiang to be detained anymore.

54
04:02.870 --> 04:04.120
So we're releasing them?

55
04:04.120 --> 04:04.960
What if...

56
04:05.080 --> 04:06.010
Just let them go.

57
04:07.960 --> 04:09.750
No, Chief.

58
04:09.770 --> 04:10.910
There isn't a word from His Majesty,

59
04:10.910 --> 04:12.700
nor a clear statement from the Eastern Palace.

60
04:12.700 --> 04:14.660
Let's just pretend we don't know.

61
04:17.720 --> 04:19.180
-Wait, Chief... -Mr. Yan.

62
04:21.430 --> 04:23.600
Chief told us to release them.

63
04:23.750 --> 04:26.080
But she didn't explicitly forbid us to...

64
04:27.040 --> 04:27.830
Tail them.

65
04:28.870 --> 04:30.200
I'll follow Huang Gang.

66
04:31.710 --> 04:33.510
[Mount Tianzhu]

67
04:39.000 --> 04:39.800
Halt!

68
04:43.070 --> 04:44.680
Inquiries from the Divine Constable Bureau.

69
04:44.680 --> 04:45.360
My Lord,

70
04:45.360 --> 04:46.510
w-we are all law-abiding people.

71
04:46.510 --> 04:47.070
My Lord.

72
04:47.070 --> 04:50.630
-Yes, we are all law-abiding people. -Don't worry. Just a few questions.

73
04:50.630 --> 04:51.390
Master Huang is said to have been

74
04:51.390 --> 04:53.630
seeking the way to immortality on Mount Tianzhu in recent years.

75
04:53.630 --> 04:55.560
He has even moved the Huang residence here.

76
04:55.560 --> 04:56.360
Is it true?

77
04:56.360 --> 04:56.950
Yes.

78
04:56.950 --> 04:57.720
-Exactly. -Master Huang

79
04:57.720 --> 04:59.240
has indeed achieved success in cultivation.

80
04:59.240 --> 05:00.870
He doesn't care for women or money,

81
05:00.870 --> 05:02.630
but he craves tasty food—the only thing

82
05:02.630 --> 05:03.630
he can't forsake.

83
05:04.880 --> 05:05.800
In that case,

84
05:05.850 --> 05:07.240
why are you taking these groceries

85
05:07.240 --> 05:08.240
back home?

86
05:09.040 --> 05:10.560
Are they not fresh?

87
05:10.830 --> 05:12.430
This time, after Master Huang returned home—

88
05:12.430 --> 05:14.030
heaven knows what happened—

89
05:14.040 --> 05:15.830
he said he achieved success in grain avoidance,

90
05:15.830 --> 05:17.830
and that he could ascend to the immortal realm soon,

91
05:17.830 --> 05:18.680
hence no longer

92
05:18.680 --> 05:20.120
needing mortal food.

93
05:20.120 --> 05:20.390
Yes.

94
05:20.390 --> 05:21.270
Not only that.

95
05:21.430 --> 05:22.480
Master Huang's family,

96
05:22.480 --> 05:23.680
which numbers over a dozen,

97
05:23.680 --> 05:24.870
wouldn't take a single bite of food.

98
05:24.870 --> 05:25.270
Who are we

99
05:25.270 --> 05:26.570
supposed to sell so many groceries to?

100
05:26.570 --> 05:31.200
[Huang Mansion]

101
05:33.970 --> 05:36.050
[Huang Mansion]

102
06:02.360 --> 06:03.430
[Constable Ghost]

103
06:03.430 --> 06:04.310
Master Huang knew

104
06:04.310 --> 06:06.070
there would be a visitor from the Divine Constable Bureau,

105
06:06.070 --> 06:06.420
so he instructed me beforehand

106
06:06.420 --> 06:07.750
[Constable Ghost]

107
06:07.750 --> 06:08.950
to answer any questions

108
06:08.950 --> 06:10.510
you might ask.

109
06:10.510 --> 06:12.190
Do you know every little thing

110
06:12.920 --> 06:13.950
about the Huang household?

111
06:13.950 --> 06:15.430
Please take a look, My Lord.

112
06:15.430 --> 06:17.430
All within this estate— high and low, old and young—

113
06:17.430 --> 06:19.950
and Master Huang's chamber for quiet cultivation

114
06:19.950 --> 06:21.160
are all laid bare to you.

115
06:21.160 --> 06:22.870
What secrets could there be?

116
06:24.510 --> 06:26.480
Here are some immortality pills given by Mr. Tang Wei

117
06:26.480 --> 06:27.720
to Master Huang.

118
06:27.750 --> 06:29.560
According to Mr. Tang, those who take these pills

119
06:29.560 --> 06:32.159
can ascend to the immortal realm in three days.

120
06:32.950 --> 06:33.880
Immortal pills?

121
06:34.270 --> 06:36.800
Why is something so important to Master Huang

122
06:36.830 --> 06:38.190
in your hands now?

123
06:38.240 --> 06:39.630
Mr. Tang said that despite

124
06:39.630 --> 06:40.920
the benefits of the immortality pills,

125
06:40.920 --> 06:42.380
they would be no different

126
06:42.390 --> 06:43.159
from ordinary rice

127
06:43.159 --> 06:45.490
and flour for those without cultivation.

128
06:45.720 --> 06:47.040
Now, it has been two days since all

129
06:47.040 --> 06:48.750
in the Huang household took the immortality pills.

130
06:48.750 --> 06:50.720
Tomorrow is the day of ascension.

131
06:51.120 --> 06:52.040
Master Huang ordered

132
06:52.040 --> 06:53.240
these extra pills to be

133
06:53.240 --> 06:56.240
given to destined ones since they're no longer of use.

134
07:10.270 --> 07:11.160
If so,

135
07:11.750 --> 07:13.680
tell Master Huang I said thank you.

136
07:15.750 --> 07:16.810
It's getting late.

137
07:16.920 --> 07:18.430
Why not spend the night here

138
07:18.430 --> 07:19.720
and watch Master Huang ascend

139
07:19.720 --> 07:21.520
to the immortal realm tomorrow?

140
07:21.630 --> 07:22.430
No need.

141
07:23.310 --> 07:24.430
I will spend the night

142
07:24.430 --> 07:25.510
on Mount Tianzhu.

143
07:26.070 --> 07:27.360
Should anything happen,

144
07:27.360 --> 07:29.560
come find me at the foot of the mountain.

145
07:31.160 --> 07:34.890
[Tang Mansion]

146
07:35.240 --> 07:36.680
On the day of the incident,

147
07:36.680 --> 07:37.750
there were four cups and four sets

148
07:37.750 --> 07:39.120
of tableware on the table

149
07:39.120 --> 07:40.830
in the sixth-floor dining room.

150
07:40.830 --> 07:42.290
Even counting Tang Wei in,

151
07:42.290 --> 07:43.870
only three sets of tableware were needed.

152
07:43.870 --> 07:45.430
Who was the fourth one for?

153
07:46.830 --> 07:48.120
And what's the message hidden

154
07:48.120 --> 07:49.650
in Tang Wei's jade pendant?

155
07:50.370 --> 07:53.530
[Tang Mansion]

156
07:55.860 --> 07:57.920
[Tang Mansion]

157
07:59.120 --> 08:01.110
Who would go out at this hour of the day?

158
08:01.110 --> 08:02.300
It's late and dark.

159
08:02.340 --> 08:02.800
How come

160
08:02.800 --> 08:04.730
there isn't even a lantern bearer?

161
08:22.750 --> 08:23.600
Come on.

162
08:23.720 --> 08:24.510
Careful.

163
08:28.430 --> 08:30.890
It turns out they are dumping a body at night.

164
08:39.390 --> 08:40.120
What is it?

165
08:40.120 --> 08:40.549
Run!

166
08:40.549 --> 08:41.320
Let's go!

167
08:41.510 --> 08:43.240
Come back! Why are you running away?

168
08:43.240 --> 08:44.700
Let's get it done quickly.

169
09:04.510 --> 09:06.390
If I take the body away now,

170
09:06.670 --> 09:08.330
the culprit might be alerted.

171
09:14.150 --> 09:14.870
This seems

172
09:14.870 --> 09:17.000
like the attire of Miaoxu Sect.

173
09:17.240 --> 09:18.360
Disciples of this sect

174
09:18.360 --> 09:20.220
have come here for drinks before.

175
09:20.360 --> 09:21.720
Go and find out

176
09:22.150 --> 09:23.670
if any disciples of Miaoxu Sect

177
09:23.670 --> 09:25.130
have gone missing lately.

178
09:25.750 --> 09:26.550
Yes.

179
09:41.720 --> 09:43.380
This pill contains no poison,

180
09:44.480 --> 09:47.140
but it's definitely unrelated to immortality.

181
10:10.360 --> 10:12.510
Don't be afraid, everyone.

182
10:13.000 --> 10:13.910
Tomorrow, we will

183
10:13.910 --> 10:15.770
all ascend to the immortal realm.

184
10:15.840 --> 10:17.910
Then we will be free from worldly attachments

185
10:17.910 --> 10:19.440
and demonic interference!

186
10:32.550 --> 10:34.480
Evil spirits and demons! There are

187
10:34.750 --> 10:36.150
evil spirits and demons!

188
10:37.480 --> 10:38.510
Immortality pills restore youth.

189
10:38.510 --> 10:39.720
Failing to gain immortality brings disasters.

190
10:39.720 --> 10:40.910
The heavenly path opens when merit is fulfilled.

191
10:40.910 --> 10:43.510
It is unknown to all till one treads the clouds.

192
10:44.590 --> 10:47.180
[Taotie Terrace]

193
10:47.550 --> 10:48.360
Look!

194
10:48.840 --> 10:49.510
Yes.

195
10:49.510 --> 10:50.840
It's the reincarnation of Zhang Guolao.

196
10:50.840 --> 10:51.870
Master Huang is ascending to immortality!

197
10:51.870 --> 10:52.550
It's his ascension.

198
10:52.550 --> 10:53.870
-He's becoming an immortal. -Immortal ascension!

199
10:53.870 --> 10:55.270
Master Huang is ascending to immortality.

200
10:55.270 --> 10:56.750
Congratulations to him!

201
10:58.240 --> 10:59.120
This is incredible.

202
10:59.120 --> 11:00.030
Look at that!

203
11:00.200 --> 11:01.630
It's an old immortal.

204
11:02.750 --> 11:05.080
Immortality pills restore youth.

205
11:05.150 --> 11:07.550
Failing to gain immortality brings disasters.

206
11:07.550 --> 11:09.720
The heavenly path opens when merit is fulfilled.

207
11:09.720 --> 11:12.440
It is unknown to all till one treads the clouds!

208
11:15.720 --> 11:18.910
Master Huang is finally returning to the immortal realm.

209
11:18.910 --> 11:20.080
A joyous occasion indeed.

210
11:20.080 --> 11:21.360
Congratulations to him.

211
11:21.360 --> 11:23.510
Master Huang is returning to the immortal realm!

212
11:23.510 --> 11:25.200
How very wonderful!

213
11:25.510 --> 11:27.910
The heavenly path opens when merit is fulfilled.

214
11:27.910 --> 11:30.510
It is unknown to all till one treads the clouds.

215
11:30.510 --> 11:32.750
The heavenly path opens when merit is fulfilled.

216
11:32.750 --> 11:35.240
It is unknown to all till one treads the clouds.

217
11:35.240 --> 11:37.440
The heavenly path opens when merit is fulfilled.

218
11:37.440 --> 11:39.030
It is unknown to all till one treads the clouds.

219
11:39.030 --> 11:39.910
Don't!

220
11:42.240 --> 11:43.000
What just happened?

221
11:43.000 --> 11:44.150
Why did they jump from here?

222
11:44.150 --> 11:45.080
Yes.

223
11:45.630 --> 11:46.440
Why did they jump?

224
11:46.440 --> 11:47.270
They jumped?

225
12:08.480 --> 12:09.240
Has Huang Gang

226
12:09.240 --> 12:11.040
truly ascended to immortality?

227
12:14.630 --> 12:15.630
Constable Ghost,

228
12:15.760 --> 12:17.080
we did our best to search and found

229
12:17.080 --> 12:18.510
the corpses below incomplete.

230
12:18.510 --> 12:19.270
The cliff is steep and high

231
12:19.270 --> 12:20.270
with the wind blowing hard.

232
12:20.270 --> 12:22.200
Shall we carry the remains up here?

233
12:22.720 --> 12:23.550
No need.

234
12:24.550 --> 12:25.510
Did you find Huang Gang?

235
12:25.510 --> 12:26.440
No, we didn't.

236
12:26.480 --> 12:27.880
We only found his donkey.

237
12:29.320 --> 12:31.050
You found Huang Gang's donkey?

238
12:31.960 --> 12:35.910
When one attains immortality, even his fouls and hounds rise to heaven.

239
12:35.910 --> 12:37.320
But why did Huang's donkey stay

240
12:37.320 --> 12:38.670
while he disappeared?

241
12:39.120 --> 12:40.550
The only thing I'm certain of

242
12:40.550 --> 12:41.270
is that Huang Gang

243
12:41.270 --> 12:43.330
didn't ascend to the immortal realm.

244
12:44.080 --> 12:45.080
In my opinion,

245
12:45.480 --> 12:46.630
he possibly

246
12:47.150 --> 12:47.870
went with

247
12:47.870 --> 12:49.390
those fools in his family

248
12:49.450 --> 12:51.480
to meet their ancestors in heaven.

249
12:53.510 --> 12:54.910
As you said, Huang Gang might be

250
12:54.910 --> 12:55.870
old and foolish.

251
12:55.870 --> 12:57.800
But what were his family thinking?

252
12:58.270 --> 13:00.270
They actually jumped off the cliff.

253
13:01.270 --> 13:02.730
Any findings on your side?

254
13:03.080 --> 13:03.840
For the past few days,

255
13:03.840 --> 13:04.480
we've been examining

256
13:04.480 --> 13:06.740
the account records of Lanyue Pavilion.

257
13:07.270 --> 13:08.790
The fourth guest hadn't

258
13:09.120 --> 13:11.380
been to Lanyue Pavilion for three years.

259
13:11.550 --> 13:12.720
Do you know why?

260
13:13.270 --> 13:14.840
Because he already died

261
13:15.120 --> 13:16.720
three years ago.

262
13:17.080 --> 13:17.910
Who was he?

263
13:18.270 --> 13:20.150
Someone who would hang out with Lord Huang,

264
13:20.150 --> 13:22.030
Lord Jiang, and Mr. Tang was

265
13:22.120 --> 13:23.670
certainly also an official.

266
13:23.670 --> 13:26.080
A high-ranking official died three years ago.

267
13:26.080 --> 13:26.840
Who was he?

268
13:28.270 --> 13:30.270
Hu Hai, the former General Zhennan.

269
13:30.910 --> 13:32.000
Exactly.

270
13:32.270 --> 13:33.270
I'm telling you,

271
13:33.440 --> 13:34.910
Hu Hai also died

272
13:34.960 --> 13:36.160
in a mystical manner.

273
13:37.720 --> 13:40.320
He was slain by the blade to attain liberation.

274
13:41.480 --> 13:43.030
I'll head to Hu Hai's abode right away.

275
13:43.030 --> 13:43.840
No need.

276
13:44.080 --> 13:44.750
I just came back

277
13:44.750 --> 13:46.240
from General Hu Hai's residence.

278
13:46.240 --> 13:47.360
I've also brought

279
13:47.360 --> 13:48.440
his butler here.

280
13:49.630 --> 13:49.810
My Lords,

281
13:49.810 --> 13:50.720
[Clear as a Mirror]

282
13:50.720 --> 13:51.910
after Master Hu resigned from office,

283
13:51.910 --> 13:53.720
he felt deeply guilty for committing too many killings,

284
13:53.720 --> 13:56.520
so he started believing in immortal cultivation.

285
13:56.750 --> 13:59.010
At that time, an immortal master told him

286
13:59.030 --> 14:00.720
that only through death by the blade

287
14:00.720 --> 14:03.720
to attain liberation could he atone for his killings.

288
14:04.750 --> 14:05.960
That immortal master

289
14:06.840 --> 14:08.870
was Mr. Tang of Lanyue Pavilion, right?

290
14:08.870 --> 14:09.670
Correct.

291
14:10.720 --> 14:12.480
On the Mid-Autumn Festival three years ago,

292
14:12.480 --> 14:13.960
our master threw himself

293
14:13.960 --> 14:15.750
into his own sword-forging furnace.

294
14:15.750 --> 14:17.270
When the fire went out,

295
14:17.270 --> 14:18.720
we opened the furnace,

296
14:18.840 --> 14:20.500
but there was nothing inside.

297
14:20.510 --> 14:21.630
Nothing inside?

298
14:21.960 --> 14:23.080
Even with blazing fires,

299
14:23.080 --> 14:24.910
there should have been ashes left.

300
14:24.910 --> 14:26.440
He couldn't have just vanished.

301
14:26.440 --> 14:28.510
So everyone in the mansion said

302
14:28.550 --> 14:30.750
that Master Hu must have succeeded in the weapon liberation

303
14:30.750 --> 14:32.750
and ascended to the immortal realm.

304
14:33.390 --> 14:34.200
My Lords.

305
14:34.240 --> 14:35.150
[Clear as a Mirror]

306
14:35.150 --> 14:36.150
My Lords,

307
14:36.240 --> 14:37.750
we found a secret passage in the sword-forging furnace

308
14:37.750 --> 14:38.880
of the Hu residence.

309
14:39.750 --> 14:41.550
Just now, when I opened the sword-forging furnace

310
14:41.550 --> 14:42.630
in General Hu Hai's mansion,

311
14:42.630 --> 14:44.150
somehow there was a strange sound.

312
14:44.150 --> 14:45.240
So I asked Ding Mao and Jiang Zhan

313
14:45.240 --> 14:46.500
to check it carefully.

314
14:46.510 --> 14:47.870
It took us some time to finally

315
14:47.870 --> 14:49.960
catch a faint glimpse of a door inside.

316
14:49.960 --> 14:51.550
However, the passage behind it

317
14:51.550 --> 14:53.210
was already blocked by rocks.

318
14:53.510 --> 14:54.910
Where does this secret passage lead?

319
14:54.910 --> 14:56.000
It leads to the dense forest

320
14:56.000 --> 14:56.960
outside the Hu residence.

321
14:56.960 --> 14:57.870
So, as expected,

322
14:57.870 --> 14:58.630
General Hu Hai

323
14:58.630 --> 15:00.320
didn't die from weapon liberation,

324
15:00.320 --> 15:01.440
but simply disappeared.

325
15:01.440 --> 15:03.030
He was probably taken away.

326
15:03.320 --> 15:04.240
After Master Hu died,

327
15:04.240 --> 15:05.080
that sword-forging furnace

328
15:05.080 --> 15:06.910
became a forbidden area in the Hu residence.

329
15:06.910 --> 15:07.790
None of us

330
15:07.790 --> 15:09.360
have ever opened it again!

331
15:09.670 --> 15:10.550
Let me ask you.

332
15:11.030 --> 15:12.670
After General Hu's passing,

333
15:12.910 --> 15:14.200
his favorite granddaughter

334
15:14.200 --> 15:15.510
also passed away.

335
15:15.550 --> 15:16.720
Is it true?

336
15:17.080 --> 15:18.270
It is true.

337
15:18.510 --> 15:20.750
On the seventh day after Master Hu's ascension,

338
15:20.750 --> 15:22.750
Her Ladyship suddenly had a dream,

339
15:22.840 --> 15:23.750
in which Master Hu told her

340
15:23.750 --> 15:25.870
that he had ascended to the heavenly realm

341
15:25.870 --> 15:27.270
where there was incomparable glory,

342
15:27.270 --> 15:29.130
and that he would bring her there.

343
15:29.670 --> 15:32.130
The next day, when I checked on Her Ladyship,

344
15:32.150 --> 15:34.150
I found her sitting straight on the bed,

345
15:34.150 --> 15:37.000
already dead.

346
15:38.720 --> 15:39.630
My Lords!

347
15:42.760 --> 15:43.570
My Lords,

348
15:43.720 --> 15:45.030
after investigation,

349
15:45.240 --> 15:47.840
I can confirm that Butler Hu is telling the truth.

350
15:47.840 --> 15:48.870
However, later on,

351
15:48.870 --> 15:50.630
as we questioned many servants,

352
15:50.630 --> 15:51.630
they all said

353
15:51.960 --> 15:53.550
that before Miss Hu was buried,

354
15:53.550 --> 15:54.360
her body

355
15:54.360 --> 15:56.080
radiated rainbow-like colors

356
15:56.080 --> 15:57.540
that lasted several days.

357
15:58.150 --> 15:59.320
I took the liberty

358
15:59.320 --> 16:00.790
to open Miss Hu's coffin.

359
16:01.150 --> 16:02.350
Here is a bone of hers.

360
16:03.770 --> 16:05.840
Her Ladyship was buried and should rest in peace.

361
16:05.840 --> 16:07.030
H-How could you...

362
16:07.270 --> 16:08.080
Don't move!

363
16:08.710 --> 16:10.370
Her body showed seven colors.

364
16:11.360 --> 16:13.160
The Seven-Flower Bliss Powder.

365
16:13.870 --> 16:14.670
In recent years,

366
16:14.670 --> 16:16.360
since Sage Wuxin, head of Miaoxu Sect, has been

367
16:16.360 --> 16:17.720
rectifying the sect's discipline,

368
16:17.720 --> 16:19.510
very few disciples would leave the mountain,

369
16:19.510 --> 16:21.200
much less go missing.

370
16:24.320 --> 16:25.390
Look at the fabric.

371
16:25.960 --> 16:28.360
This garment was made years ago, wasn't it?

372
16:36.360 --> 16:37.440
It is an old garment.

373
16:37.440 --> 16:38.910
Go talk lto Sage Wuxin again.

374
16:38.910 --> 16:39.870
Ask him

375
16:40.270 --> 16:42.770
for the list of all missing female cultivators

376
16:42.770 --> 16:44.940
of Miaoxu Sect in the past 10 years.

377
16:46.270 --> 16:47.080
Yes.

378
16:51.340 --> 16:52.940
Master, where are you going?

379
16:54.360 --> 16:56.670
This whole thing has cost me one day and one night.

380
16:56.670 --> 16:58.510
I have to go to Jiang Zeshui's place now,

381
16:58.510 --> 17:00.710
or I'm afraid something might go wrong.

382
17:09.510 --> 17:12.030
Jin Se, you may leave now.

383
17:45.880 --> 17:47.010
Why is my old illness

384
17:47.070 --> 17:49.070
acting up more and more frequently?

385
17:51.680 --> 17:52.480
That is to say,

386
17:52.480 --> 17:53.920
Hu Hai was taken away by someone,

387
17:53.920 --> 17:55.120
and so was Huang Gang.

388
17:56.960 --> 17:58.440
Now this is odd.

389
17:59.160 --> 18:00.420
Among the three guests

390
18:00.750 --> 18:02.830
on the sixth floor of Lanyue Pavilion,

391
18:02.830 --> 18:04.480
two went missing,

392
18:04.830 --> 18:05.760
and the other one

393
18:05.830 --> 18:07.350
died in a mystical manner.

394
18:08.310 --> 18:09.880
Given all that...

395
18:10.510 --> 18:11.270
This is bad.

396
18:12.550 --> 18:14.880
I'm afraid Jiang Zeshui is also in danger.

397
18:17.070 --> 18:19.660
A visit to the Jiang residence seems like a must.

398
18:19.660 --> 18:21.230
Got it. I'll be on my way.

399
18:21.250 --> 18:21.960
Sure.

400
18:23.790 --> 18:25.910
[Jiang Mansion]

401
18:26.070 --> 18:27.590
-Lord Constable Iron. -Lord Constable Iron.

402
18:27.590 --> 18:28.310
What have you found?

403
18:28.310 --> 18:29.270
Lord Constable Iron,

404
18:29.270 --> 18:30.830
Lord Jiang has been staying indoors

405
18:30.830 --> 18:31.960
these past few days.

406
18:32.150 --> 18:33.270
Those in the residence all say

407
18:33.270 --> 18:34.960
that he won't meet guests as he is about to ascend

408
18:34.960 --> 18:35.890
to immortality.

409
18:36.450 --> 18:37.550
Over the past few days of standing

410
18:37.550 --> 18:39.000
guard here, we haven't seen any visitors.

411
18:39.000 --> 18:41.240
Farewell, Master!

412
18:41.350 --> 18:41.600
Quick!

413
18:41.600 --> 18:41.880
[Jiang Mansion]

414
18:41.880 --> 18:42.750
-Oh no. -Quick!

415
18:43.570 --> 18:44.550
[Ascending to Immortality]

416
18:44.550 --> 18:49.480
Farewell, Master. May we reach the Pure Land together.

417
18:49.570 --> 18:54.400
Farewell, Master. May we reach the Pure Land together.

418
18:54.480 --> 18:57.200
-Hurry! Stop, all of you! -Everyone, stop!

419
18:57.440 --> 18:58.440
Quick, stop them!

420
18:58.510 --> 18:59.880
Go help them out!

421
19:00.680 --> 19:01.270
Get back here!

422
19:01.270 --> 19:04.400
-A cultivator should have a peaceful mind. -Who are you?

423
19:04.480 --> 19:07.550
Do not let worldly matters burden your heart.

424
19:07.550 --> 19:08.000
Come up here!

425
19:08.000 --> 19:08.750
Lord Jiang?

426
19:08.750 --> 19:09.550
This is bad.

427
19:09.640 --> 19:10.270
Save these people!

428
19:10.270 --> 19:12.930
Casting aside worldly affairs with both hands,

429
19:13.310 --> 19:17.310
I step onto the lotus bringing me to the other shore.

430
19:18.110 --> 19:22.270
My feet feel light as if I were treading the clouds.

431
19:22.440 --> 19:23.070
Lord Jiang!

432
19:23.070 --> 19:27.510
My body lies in the void beyond the farthest heaven.

433
19:28.350 --> 19:30.240
How is he able to walk on water?

434
19:33.360 --> 19:34.220
This is urgent.

435
19:36.500 --> 19:38.160
Are you planning to swim over?

436
19:40.030 --> 19:41.960
How else am I supposed to get there?

437
19:42.070 --> 19:44.590
On foot, of course.

438
19:44.590 --> 19:45.310
On foot?

439
20:06.310 --> 20:07.110
Hidden posts?

440
20:08.110 --> 20:09.110
Now I understand.

441
20:09.680 --> 20:11.270
Immortal magic doesn't exist at all.

442
20:11.270 --> 20:13.510
There are just stepping posts in the water.

443
20:13.510 --> 20:15.510
This is the path to immortality. I am to become an immortal.

444
20:15.510 --> 20:18.510
-This is the path to immortality. I am... -Lord Jiang.

445
20:23.920 --> 20:26.480
You foolish man obsessed with the mundane world,

446
20:26.480 --> 20:28.210
repent and turn back already.

447
20:28.720 --> 20:29.590
Lord Jiang,

448
20:30.310 --> 20:31.610
you are the one who should turn back.

449
20:31.610 --> 20:33.750
I won't argue with you about the credibility

450
20:33.750 --> 20:35.200
of cultivation for now.

451
20:35.240 --> 20:36.900
But if the immortals in heaven

452
20:36.960 --> 20:39.760
only know to play mysterious tricks like this one,

453
20:40.070 --> 20:41.670
then I don't think you should

454
20:42.030 --> 20:43.290
continue on this path.

455
20:45.510 --> 20:48.100
In all my life, for saving countless lives by harnessing rivers,

456
20:48.100 --> 20:49.580
I've earned merit.

457
20:49.960 --> 20:52.670
These immortal posts were naturally formed.

458
20:52.720 --> 20:54.000
Together they pave a path

459
20:54.000 --> 20:56.070
to immortality for me by the will of heaven.

460
20:56.070 --> 20:57.800
So you do remember you've spent

461
20:57.920 --> 20:59.640
all your life harnessing rivers.

462
20:59.640 --> 21:00.680
Let me ask you.

463
21:01.350 --> 21:03.550
You have built many waterways in your life.

464
21:03.550 --> 21:04.550
Have you ever seen

465
21:04.550 --> 21:06.480
posts form naturally under water?

466
21:06.680 --> 21:09.610
Could naturally formed stalagmites and stone steps

467
21:10.510 --> 21:12.590
be in such an orderly arrangement?

468
21:12.790 --> 21:13.590
You...

469
21:14.070 --> 21:15.000
I get it!

470
21:15.310 --> 21:17.480
You must be a demon in disguise, intentionally

471
21:17.480 --> 21:18.750
obstructing my way to immortality!

472
21:18.750 --> 21:20.160
I might as well tell you the truth.

473
21:20.160 --> 21:21.920
On Taotie Terrace where Huang Gang ascended,

474
21:21.920 --> 21:24.070
there are chains connecting to a ladder hidden in the clouds.

475
21:24.070 --> 21:26.270
And inside Hu Hai's sword-forging furnace,

476
21:26.270 --> 21:28.510
there is a secret door leading to the suburbs.

477
21:28.510 --> 21:29.270
They didn't

478
21:29.270 --> 21:30.590
go to the immortal realm at all,

479
21:30.590 --> 21:32.330
but were taken away by someone.

480
21:33.510 --> 21:34.320
Lord Jiang,

481
21:34.920 --> 21:36.790
take one more step forward,

482
21:37.550 --> 21:38.310
and you will

483
21:38.310 --> 21:39.880
end up the same as them.

484
21:40.000 --> 21:41.680
What proof do you have?

485
21:41.680 --> 21:42.680
Proof?

486
21:56.880 --> 21:57.790
Lord Jiang.

487
21:59.550 --> 22:02.350
The donkey that Huang Gang rode on his way to ascension

488
22:02.350 --> 22:03.880
is still in the human world.

489
22:08.000 --> 22:08.830
Lord Jiang.

490
22:11.830 --> 22:13.430
Come back and save yourself.

491
22:38.830 --> 22:39.790
My Lord, there are indeed

492
22:39.790 --> 22:41.440
secret mechanisms and a cave hidden in the water.

493
22:41.440 --> 22:44.770
It is utterly deep and leading straight out of the mountain.

494
22:46.110 --> 22:48.350
Jiang Zeshui was captured by demon-men.

495
22:48.350 --> 22:50.240
I assume the same just happened

496
22:50.240 --> 22:51.550
to Huang Gang and Hu Hai.

497
22:51.550 --> 22:54.030
As expected, this case

498
22:54.550 --> 22:56.030
is truly related to Liluo.

499
23:04.030 --> 23:04.960
Anything wrong?

500
23:09.240 --> 23:11.440
Nothing. Just an old ailment acting up.

501
23:13.350 --> 23:14.160
This is the first time

502
23:14.160 --> 23:15.830
we've caught a living demon-man.

503
23:15.830 --> 23:16.680
Let's give him a good whipping

504
23:16.680 --> 23:18.050
when we're back to the bureau,

505
23:18.050 --> 23:19.160
and see if he'll spill anything.

506
23:19.160 --> 23:20.000
Let me ask you.

507
23:20.550 --> 23:22.480
Where were you in the past few days?

508
23:24.720 --> 23:26.030
Do I even need to report to you

509
23:26.030 --> 23:27.310
about where I've been?

510
23:27.790 --> 23:29.030
You're not the chief.

511
23:29.400 --> 23:30.720
If you had come back earlier,

512
23:30.720 --> 23:32.000
things would have been different

513
23:32.000 --> 23:33.790
and Jiang Zeshui wouldn't have been captured.

514
23:33.790 --> 23:35.830
At least there are still living souls in the Jiang household.

515
23:35.830 --> 23:36.890
However, I heard

516
23:36.960 --> 23:38.440
that none in the Huang household

517
23:38.440 --> 23:39.240
that you were looking into

518
23:39.240 --> 23:40.350
had survived.

519
23:40.920 --> 23:41.980
Oh right, Meng Rui.

520
23:42.240 --> 23:43.720
You're like the Grim Reaper.

521
23:43.720 --> 23:45.580
Wherever you go, many people die.

522
23:45.920 --> 23:47.290
I'm just kidding.

523
23:47.720 --> 23:49.980
Wipe that icy look off your face already.

524
24:02.550 --> 24:03.610
What's the matter?

525
24:03.920 --> 24:05.590
Did you smell something?

526
24:05.750 --> 24:07.110
Yes, a unique scent.

527
24:07.960 --> 24:09.440
I think I've smelled it somewhere before,

528
24:09.440 --> 24:10.500
but I can't name it.

529
24:12.720 --> 24:14.920
Besides being obsessed with cultivation,

530
24:14.920 --> 24:16.030
was there anything else unusual

531
24:16.030 --> 24:17.790
about Lord Jiang before the incident?

532
24:17.790 --> 24:19.830
If I have to name one thing, then I'd say

533
24:19.830 --> 24:22.640
the master constantly had nightmares in the past few years.

534
24:22.640 --> 24:23.440
Yes.

535
24:23.720 --> 24:25.590
I also remember the master having nightmares.

536
24:25.590 --> 24:26.720
On the night of the Mid-Autumn Festival,

537
24:26.720 --> 24:27.440
the whole family was waiting

538
24:27.440 --> 24:28.920
for the master to wake up from meditation

539
24:28.920 --> 24:30.240
so as to admire the moon together.

540
24:30.240 --> 24:31.040
That's right.

541
24:31.110 --> 24:31.920
All of a sudden,

542
24:31.920 --> 24:33.960
the master started yelling in his room

543
24:33.960 --> 24:35.400
and broke out in a cold sweat all over,

544
24:35.400 --> 24:37.730
muttering about things like retribution

545
24:37.790 --> 24:39.120
and karmic infliction.

546
24:39.400 --> 24:40.440
Did you just say

547
24:40.790 --> 24:42.520
this only began a few years ago?

548
24:42.720 --> 24:43.510
Yes.

549
24:43.790 --> 24:44.590
Yes.

550
24:47.030 --> 24:49.960
Then for him, death was better than living.

551
24:50.440 --> 24:51.750
It didn't happen every day.

552
24:51.750 --> 24:54.210
The master's nightmares came at intervals.

553
24:54.640 --> 24:55.890
But I can't remember

554
24:56.030 --> 24:57.510
exactly how long.

555
25:13.240 --> 25:14.300
Little did I expect

556
25:14.640 --> 25:16.040
the Lanyue Pavilion case

557
25:16.340 --> 25:18.600
to be related to Liluo and the Dark Night.

558
25:32.510 --> 25:33.310
Zhenzhu.

559
25:33.960 --> 25:34.790
Previously,

560
25:34.790 --> 25:36.790
you examined the body of Hu Hai's granddaughter.

561
25:36.790 --> 25:39.030
What was the real cause of her death?

562
25:39.350 --> 25:41.510
Miss Hu's bones are dark blue, proving

563
25:41.790 --> 25:43.120
that she died of poison.

564
25:43.590 --> 25:44.550
Now, it seems all these

565
25:44.550 --> 25:45.070
happenings

566
25:45.070 --> 25:46.640
are part of a huge conspiracy.

567
25:46.640 --> 25:48.040
Lord Huang and Lord Jiang

568
25:48.200 --> 25:49.720
are probably dead now.

569
25:49.830 --> 25:51.360
Suppose they already died,

570
25:51.640 --> 25:53.590
where are their bodies now?

571
25:54.110 --> 25:54.750
Why did

572
25:54.750 --> 25:56.680
their bodies have to be taken away?

573
25:58.680 --> 25:59.480
Chief,

574
25:59.640 --> 26:00.970
the clues have dried up.

575
26:01.000 --> 26:02.160
Please instruct us

576
26:02.960 --> 26:04.360
on how to proceed, Chief.

577
26:08.310 --> 26:10.170
Although the clues have dried up,

578
26:10.400 --> 26:12.330
we are not entirely out of options.

579
26:14.400 --> 26:16.550
The disappearances of these three officials,

580
26:16.550 --> 26:18.610
Huang Gang, Jiang Zeshui, and Hu Hai,

581
26:18.640 --> 26:20.300
are all related to one person.

582
26:22.920 --> 26:23.750
It's Tang Wei.

583
26:24.400 --> 26:25.200
Tang Wei?

584
26:26.030 --> 26:28.110
But isn't he dead already?

585
26:28.240 --> 26:29.790
Assign people to keep watch on the Tang residence for now.

586
26:29.790 --> 26:31.000
Call it surveillance

587
26:31.000 --> 26:32.600
or protection as you see fit.

588
26:33.350 --> 26:34.160
Yes.

589
26:34.790 --> 26:35.640
Zhenzhu,

590
26:36.030 --> 26:37.350
I need you to find out

591
26:37.590 --> 26:38.440
if these three officials

592
26:38.440 --> 26:39.790
had common enemies,

593
26:39.790 --> 26:41.750
or if their enemies

594
26:41.750 --> 26:43.440
are related to Liluo.

595
26:44.030 --> 26:44.790
Yes.

596
26:45.830 --> 26:46.790
Chief!

597
26:50.030 --> 26:51.030
Chief,

598
26:51.110 --> 26:52.750
the demon-man locked up in the dungeon

599
26:52.750 --> 26:53.950
suddenly went crazy.

600
26:56.350 --> 26:57.610
Why is this happening?

601
26:57.830 --> 26:59.200
After withstanding all that torture,

602
26:59.200 --> 27:01.060
how did he suddenly lose his mind?

603
27:07.510 --> 27:08.370
This demon-man

604
27:08.550 --> 27:09.720
seems to be experiencing

605
27:09.720 --> 27:11.030
some sort of severe pain.

606
27:11.030 --> 27:11.790
Severe pain?

607
27:13.790 --> 27:15.110
Severe pain?

608
27:17.440 --> 27:19.350
See, he can't feel pain, can he?

609
27:23.030 --> 27:24.160
Li Si is right.

610
27:24.160 --> 27:25.000
Something must have

611
27:25.000 --> 27:27.200
gone wrong with this demon-man's body.

612
27:30.440 --> 27:32.030
Ding Mao, get Tao here now.

613
27:32.030 --> 27:32.750
No.

614
27:32.750 --> 27:34.160
We can't put Tao at risk.

615
27:38.720 --> 27:39.520
Do be careful.

616
27:49.200 --> 27:50.460
Reinforce the chains!

617
28:06.110 --> 28:06.750
Why are you

618
28:06.750 --> 28:08.440
just like Li Qingyang,

619
28:08.440 --> 28:10.240
coming and going as you please?

620
28:11.440 --> 28:12.880
It seems the secret of the Underworld Market

621
28:12.880 --> 28:14.420
will be revealed soon.

622
28:14.920 --> 28:16.450
Who knows how much longer

623
28:16.640 --> 28:18.370
I can keep this clinic running.

624
28:18.440 --> 28:19.790
I'm here for an inquiry.

625
28:20.030 --> 28:21.240
Is there a herb

626
28:21.310 --> 28:23.440
that can be used as a painting pigment?

627
28:23.640 --> 28:25.100
There are plenty of those.

628
28:25.590 --> 28:26.640
I wonder, My Lord,

629
28:26.960 --> 28:28.690
what color you are looking for.

630
28:28.960 --> 28:29.750
I don't know.

631
28:30.440 --> 28:32.200
You don't even know?

632
28:32.750 --> 28:34.150
But I remember its smell.

633
28:34.510 --> 28:36.170
It is in your clinic right now.

634
28:53.750 --> 28:55.160
Which herb are you looking for, exactly?

635
28:55.160 --> 28:56.960
You're making a mess of my place.

636
28:57.440 --> 28:58.790
Forgive me for not walking you out.

637
28:58.790 --> 28:59.790
This way, please.

638
29:25.640 --> 29:27.240
Why would this totem change?

639
29:27.640 --> 29:28.550
The pattern

640
29:28.880 --> 29:29.590
was painted

641
29:29.590 --> 29:31.160
with a special pigment.

642
29:39.550 --> 29:40.350
This is it.

643
29:41.790 --> 29:43.200
So it is not a herb,

644
29:43.240 --> 29:44.350
but a pigment.

645
29:45.920 --> 29:47.000
Do you think there are

646
29:47.000 --> 29:48.400
only herbs in my clinic?

647
29:48.510 --> 29:49.590
This pigment

648
29:50.030 --> 29:52.000
is named Lanweichun.

649
29:55.440 --> 29:56.750
Lanweichun...

650
30:00.160 --> 30:01.160
Impressive!

651
30:01.400 --> 30:02.660
You actually found it.

652
30:03.310 --> 30:05.550
And you said this is Lanweichun?

653
30:05.960 --> 30:08.160
This pigment has two characteristics.

654
30:08.160 --> 30:08.960
For one thing,

655
30:08.960 --> 30:09.640
after it's used,

656
30:09.640 --> 30:10.640
the patterns created with it

657
30:10.640 --> 30:11.920
will naturally fade in two hours.

658
30:11.920 --> 30:13.160
Only on a full-moon night

659
30:13.160 --> 30:14.350
when Yin energy is at its peak

660
30:14.350 --> 30:15.790
will the patterns reappear.

661
30:15.790 --> 30:16.850
A full-moon night?

662
30:17.400 --> 30:19.260
